1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,837
Countries worldwide

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,090
are battling
a discrete yet fierce information warfare.

3
00:00:07,716 --> 00:00:09,801
Two countries are in a standoff.

4
00:00:09,884 --> 00:00:12,053
Ostania in the east.

5
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:14,097
Westalis in the west.

6
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:18,727
Westalis launched Operation Strix
to find out the movements of

7
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:22,272
key figures in the Ostanian government,
who are plotting a war.

8
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:25,066
B-1 Agent Twilight,
in charge of the operation,

9
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,193
has successfully completed Phase One,

10
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:28,987
which was to create a family,

11
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:32,365
and enroll his daughter into
a prestigious school.

12
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:36,828
Father is a spy.

13
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:39,247
Mother is an assassin.

14
00:00:40,206 --> 00:00:42,125
Daughter is a telepath.

15
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:47,046
The mission continues, as all three
hide their identities from each other.

16
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:50,133
To date, they've managed to secure

17
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:54,471
one of the eight Stellas that are
necessary to become an honor student.

18
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:57,307
The mission has now entered Phase Two,

19
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,808
which is to attend

20
00:00:58,892 --> 00:01:02,979
the reception where the target,
Desmond, will appear.

21
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:12,030
ORIGINAL WORK BY TATSUYA ENDO
SERIALIZED ON SHUEISHA'S SHONEN JUMP PLUS

22
00:02:44,831 --> 00:02:47,709
All right. Everything is ready.

23
00:02:48,543 --> 00:02:49,794
Let's get started.

24
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,464
Onto further news.

25
00:02:54,090 --> 00:02:57,635
Minister Brantz arrived at
Berlint Airport yesterday afternoon

26
00:02:57,719 --> 00:03:00,346
with a delegation from Westalis.

27
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:03,224
They will try to arrange
a discussion between

28
00:03:03,308 --> 00:03:06,853
the East and West at the summit
that begins tonight…

29
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:18,948
Are you okay?

30
00:03:19,741 --> 00:03:22,410
Hey. Eat slowly.

31
00:03:23,369 --> 00:03:24,329
Thanks for the food!

32
00:03:25,705 --> 00:03:27,999
Father, Mother, hurry up!

33
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:34,047
-She's so restless.
-She can't help it.

34
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:37,217
Because today is the day…

35
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:38,676
MISSION:13
PROJECT APPLE

36
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:43,514
The dog goes bark, bark

37
00:03:43,598 --> 00:03:45,642
Anya, you're in such a good mood.

38
00:03:46,726 --> 00:03:49,103
Do dogs eat peanuts?

39
00:03:49,187 --> 00:03:51,439
I heard it's best not to give them those.

40
00:03:51,522 --> 00:03:53,149
What? Boo.

41
00:03:53,233 --> 00:03:55,610
Let's give the doggie what he likes.

42
00:03:55,693 --> 00:03:57,737
The reason for our outing today,

43
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:00,698
or rather the objective
of Operation Strix…

44
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:02,825
is the pet shop.

45
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:04,744
We're here.

46
00:04:06,537 --> 00:04:10,583
It's because Anya said that she wanted
a dog as a reward for getting a Stella.

47
00:04:13,086 --> 00:04:15,880
Until she gets eight Stellas
for me to attend the reception,

48
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:18,424
I must make sure to keep her motivated.

49
00:04:18,508 --> 00:04:21,678
A reward! Reward! Bark, bark!

50
00:04:22,929 --> 00:04:24,180
Welcome!

51
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:30,603
Well, what do you say?

52
00:04:30,687 --> 00:04:34,190
All of them have received
hands-on practical training.

53
00:04:34,274 --> 00:04:37,610
This shop is backed by the organization
and they sell military dogs.

54
00:04:38,194 --> 00:04:42,240
I thought we might as well get a dog
that we can count on for security, but…

55
00:04:44,242 --> 00:04:46,869
These dogs are cute, and look intelligent.

56
00:04:46,953 --> 00:04:48,162
Right, Anya?

57
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:55,878
Oh no! That look on her face
means she really hates it!

58
00:04:56,754 --> 00:04:59,882
Don't you have ones that are
smaller and cuter?

59
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:03,428
-Anya doesn't want them.
-I can ask a fellow breeder.

60
00:05:03,511 --> 00:05:05,722
Yes, they look a bit scary.

61
00:05:08,057 --> 00:05:11,936
Apparently, there's an adoption event
going on right now at the shelter.

62
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:14,022
Then we'll head over there.

63
00:05:17,692 --> 00:05:19,235
A new mission?

64
00:05:22,155 --> 00:05:25,033
Sorry. My stomach isn't feeling well,

65
00:05:25,116 --> 00:05:27,952
so can you head over to the shelter
by the train station?

66
00:05:28,036 --> 00:05:29,162
I'll look for a restroom.

67
00:05:29,912 --> 00:05:32,790
Are you okay?
I think we should wait for you here.

68
00:05:32,874 --> 00:05:36,627
Father shits for a really long time,
so we should head out first.

69
00:05:36,711 --> 00:05:39,922
Is… Is that right? I understand.

70
00:05:40,006 --> 00:05:42,258
Don't use such foul language.

71
00:05:42,341 --> 00:05:45,928
Although that was a good save…
it's a little…

72
00:05:47,346 --> 00:05:50,933
Wait a minute! You didn't tell me that
we were going to the Headquarters!

73
00:05:51,684 --> 00:05:54,270
My family will get suspicious
if I take too long.

74
00:05:54,353 --> 00:05:57,899
Make your complaints to your handler.
You were called for an emergency.

75
00:06:00,401 --> 00:06:02,653
An assassination plot
against Minister Brantz?

76
00:06:03,321 --> 00:06:05,948
They're probably plotting
against the summit tonight.

77
00:06:06,032 --> 00:06:09,243
We believe the criminals are a group of

78
00:06:09,327 --> 00:06:12,246
isolationist students
from Berlint University.

79
00:06:12,330 --> 00:06:15,166
The Secret Police were keeping
an eye on them as well.

80
00:06:15,833 --> 00:06:20,421
We caught one of them stalking around
the embassy, and he's being interrogated.

81
00:06:21,297 --> 00:06:24,175
But he hasn't given any information
about his friends.

82
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:27,303
And… that's why I was called?

83
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:29,514
You're a dad and an agent.

84
00:06:29,597 --> 00:06:32,266
Wearing two hats must be difficult.

85
00:06:32,350 --> 00:06:34,435
Being a father is a part of my mission.

86
00:06:35,311 --> 00:06:37,271
But is this what the world is coming to?

87
00:06:38,856 --> 00:06:41,526
Young kids like this are becoming
terrorists now?

88
00:06:48,282 --> 00:06:50,284
You'll never be able to make me talk!

89
00:06:50,868 --> 00:06:52,161
I won't sell out my friends.

90
00:06:54,413 --> 00:06:57,375
That's fine. We don't need you anymore.

91
00:06:57,458 --> 00:07:00,419
We caught your leader.

92
00:07:06,968 --> 00:07:07,844
Keith!

93
00:07:08,678 --> 00:07:12,849
It's him!
He's the one that planned it all!

94
00:07:12,932 --> 00:07:15,852
He persuaded us to join him!

95
00:07:15,935 --> 00:07:18,771
-Believe me! It's not my fault!
-Hey Keith! What are you saying?

96
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:20,440
I'll tell you everything.

97
00:07:20,523 --> 00:07:23,526
-Please let me go!
-Quiet! Keep walking!

98
00:07:25,862 --> 00:07:29,449
That bastard! He's planning to frame me?

99
00:07:29,532 --> 00:07:31,409
What a great friend.

100
00:07:32,618 --> 00:07:36,164
Well, I don't care who the leader is.

101
00:07:36,247 --> 00:07:39,959
All we care about is the person
who will give us the information.

102
00:07:41,085 --> 00:07:43,296
Now, you will be taken to--

103
00:07:43,379 --> 00:07:45,673
Wait! It's not me! He's the leader!

104
00:07:45,756 --> 00:07:49,844
I'm not lying! He's the one
that came to us with the plans!

105
00:07:50,761 --> 00:07:52,972
Let's hear all the details.

106
00:07:54,807 --> 00:07:56,392
Keith planned everything.

107
00:07:56,476 --> 00:07:57,935
It's a good thing

108
00:07:58,019 --> 00:08:01,314
we found video footage of Keith.

109
00:08:01,981 --> 00:08:05,818
It was almost impossible to be disguised
as Keith based on such short footage.

110
00:08:06,402 --> 00:08:09,030
If that kid was a professional,
he would've seen through me.

111
00:08:10,907 --> 00:08:13,701
There's also Kevin and Kim
from the Engineering Department.

112
00:08:14,285 --> 00:08:16,746
That's everyone that I know of.

113
00:08:16,829 --> 00:08:19,874
We used the warehouse
near the university as our hideout,

114
00:08:19,957 --> 00:08:21,751
and the room above the bar on 11th Avenue.

115
00:08:22,752 --> 00:08:25,254
What's the specific plan
for the assassination?

116
00:08:28,716 --> 00:08:29,759
Dogs.

117
00:08:30,968 --> 00:08:32,595
I don't know the exact number,

118
00:08:32,678 --> 00:08:36,849
but a few dozen dogs will be strapped
with bombs,

119
00:08:36,933 --> 00:08:39,352
and they're going to attack
during transit.

120
00:08:40,603 --> 00:08:42,104
Bomb dogs?

121
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:46,817
This is not good. It's difficult to stop
dogs that have been trained.

122
00:08:46,901 --> 00:08:50,655
I can't believe this.
Providing military training for one dog,

123
00:08:50,738 --> 00:08:53,908
costs as much as a small missile.

124
00:08:54,534 --> 00:08:58,079
I can hardly believe that college students
would have that kind of money.

125
00:08:58,162 --> 00:09:00,331
Now we're seeing a possibility

126
00:09:00,414 --> 00:09:04,627
of a far-right group
or a foreign country backing them.

127
00:09:06,295 --> 00:09:09,215
As you already heard,
things have become complicated.

128
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:13,928
We must get a head start,
in order to stop this terrorist attack.

129
00:09:14,470 --> 00:09:16,430
How about we cancel the summit?

130
00:09:16,514 --> 00:09:20,184
That'll be impossible. It will make
the East's ruling party look bad.

131
00:09:20,268 --> 00:09:22,853
Although it would please
the opposing party.

132
00:09:23,771 --> 00:09:26,816
Leak this information to the ruling party.

133
00:09:26,899 --> 00:09:29,402
They would want to avoid
any unnecessary problems.

134
00:09:29,485 --> 00:09:30,361
Yes.

135
00:09:31,445 --> 00:09:34,031
I'm sorry, but we'll need you
a little longer.

136
00:09:34,115 --> 00:09:34,991
I understand.

137
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:38,202
The relationship between East and West
is on thin ice.

138
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:41,455
In addition to the outcome
of this assassination plot,

139
00:09:41,539 --> 00:09:44,625
this information becoming public
could also put things at risk.

140
00:09:45,418 --> 00:09:48,129
We will prevent this at all costs.

141
00:09:56,470 --> 00:09:59,307
I'm going to go buy some coffee.
Wait here.

142
00:09:59,974 --> 00:10:02,101
Be good, tail-waggers.

143
00:10:03,644 --> 00:10:05,855
These dogs sure are smart.

144
00:10:05,938 --> 00:10:08,274
Although they seem to be pretty old.

145
00:10:19,619 --> 00:10:20,578
Careful.

146
00:10:22,038 --> 00:10:23,998
Don't run. You'll fall.

147
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:25,583
Hey, stop!

148
00:10:30,171 --> 00:10:32,965
-Hey, what are you doing?
-He's going to eat me!

149
00:10:37,637 --> 00:10:40,890
-That signboard came crashing down!
-That was close!

150
00:10:40,973 --> 00:10:43,559
Did you save me?

151
00:10:43,643 --> 00:10:44,894
Thank you.

152
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:48,481
Sorry about my dog.

153
00:10:48,564 --> 00:10:50,316
Don't go off on your own, idiot!

154
00:10:50,399 --> 00:10:53,569
-What happened?
-He ran off on his own.

155
00:10:54,111 --> 00:10:56,822
Is it really a good idea
to use these dogs?

156
00:10:56,906 --> 00:10:59,575
It's too late to change our plans now.

157
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:03,579
We finished inspecting and marking
the area, so let's head back.

158
00:11:03,663 --> 00:11:07,458
We don't want to get Keith mad.
That'll be troublesome.

159
00:11:16,926 --> 00:11:20,262
So this is what an adoption event
looks like? It's a grand event!

160
00:11:21,347 --> 00:11:25,518
I wonder why Loid didn't choose
to come here to begin with?

161
00:11:26,435 --> 00:11:28,020
These doggies are small!

162
00:11:28,604 --> 00:11:29,855
And cats!

163
00:11:30,481 --> 00:11:32,274
And rabbits!

164
00:11:32,358 --> 00:11:35,653
Don't run around Anya. You'll get lost!

165
00:11:36,737 --> 00:11:37,613
Listen up.

166
00:11:37,696 --> 00:11:41,659
You must not leave this doggie corner
on your own.

167
00:11:41,742 --> 00:11:42,660
Understood.

168
00:11:44,495 --> 00:11:46,664
That dachshund is so cute!

169
00:11:46,747 --> 00:11:48,833
Look at those short legs!

170
00:11:48,916 --> 00:11:53,546
They're cute even when
they're short-legged? Is Anya cute too?

171
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:57,049
Chihuahua! Pomeranian!

172
00:11:57,133 --> 00:11:58,801
Breathe…

173
00:11:58,884 --> 00:12:00,511
Are you looking for a dog?

174
00:12:01,303 --> 00:12:03,889
Do you have a breed that's easy to raise?

175
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:06,225
Breathe…

176
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:11,397
What a big dog.

177
00:12:20,865 --> 00:12:22,408
It's Anya's house.

178
00:12:24,076 --> 00:12:26,162
What's wrong? Hurry up and walk!

179
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:31,500
What I saw right now… Did that image
come from that doggie's mind?

180
00:12:34,545 --> 00:12:38,591
A toy poodle doesn't shed much,
so it's fairly easy to maintain.

181
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:44,096
Mother! I saw a dog that knows
about our house!

182
00:12:44,597 --> 00:12:47,016
Hm? What are you talking about?

183
00:12:50,436 --> 00:12:53,731
As for smaller dogs,
Shih Tzus are very gentle…

184
00:12:59,445 --> 00:13:01,155
I'll take a quick look…

185
00:13:03,616 --> 00:13:04,867
Is this a store?

186
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:11,499
Where is that doggie?

187
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,591
Doggie.

188
00:13:27,723 --> 00:13:29,517
Who are you?

189
00:13:32,061 --> 00:13:34,647
You better have not attracted
any attention.

190
00:13:35,231 --> 00:13:36,815
No worries!

191
00:13:36,899 --> 00:13:40,069
There was an adoption event,
so everyone had dogs.

192
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:42,821
The time has finally come.

193
00:13:42,905 --> 00:13:47,076
If this plan using the bomb dogs succeeds,

194
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:50,371
the relation between the east and west
will undoubtedly come to an end.

195
00:13:50,913 --> 00:13:54,583
In order to bring Ostania back
to its former glory,

196
00:13:54,667 --> 00:13:56,794
we will have Minister Brantz

197
00:13:56,877 --> 00:13:59,922
become a smoke signal
that announces the start of war.

198
00:14:00,422 --> 00:14:04,051
We'll crush those arrogant pigs
in Westalis!

199
00:14:04,134 --> 00:14:05,261
We'll crush them!

200
00:14:05,344 --> 00:14:07,471
They're bad guys?

201
00:14:08,222 --> 00:14:10,724
This house belongs to the bad guys!

202
00:14:19,108 --> 00:14:20,985
Hey! What are you guys doing?

203
00:14:21,735 --> 00:14:23,737
This kid was eavesdropping on you guys!

204
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:25,865
Are you serious? Who is that?

205
00:14:26,574 --> 00:14:28,576
Wh… what should we do?

206
00:14:30,703 --> 00:14:32,621
You're wondering what to do?

207
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,293
We obviously have to get rid of her.

208
00:14:45,134 --> 00:14:48,178
Stop it, Keith! She's just a kid.

209
00:14:49,889 --> 00:14:52,892
Our plan will be ruined
if she goes and tattles to her parents.

210
00:14:54,977 --> 00:14:57,813
Kurt, cover her mouth.

211
00:15:00,941 --> 00:15:01,734
-Whoa!
-Oh!

212
00:15:06,614 --> 00:15:08,032
Doggie.

213
00:15:08,115 --> 00:15:10,701
He's running around on his own again.

214
00:15:10,784 --> 00:15:12,786
It seems like he's a defect.

215
00:15:15,205 --> 00:15:17,374
You chose the wrong person to bark at!

216
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:19,043
I'll shut you up.

217
00:15:24,924 --> 00:15:25,799
Huh?

218
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:31,972
That idiot.

219
00:15:32,056 --> 00:15:34,642
Stop it. Don't waste your weapon on him.

220
00:15:34,725 --> 00:15:37,353
But we have to shut him up.

221
00:15:37,436 --> 00:15:39,271
Don't worry about that.

222
00:15:39,355 --> 00:15:43,150
No one would think anything
of a barking dog today.

223
00:15:44,109 --> 00:15:48,238
Anya! Where are you?

224
00:15:48,322 --> 00:15:52,826
Excuse me! Have you seen a small child
with two little ornaments on her head?

225
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:53,869
I'm not sure.

226
00:15:53,953 --> 00:15:55,329
I don't think I have.

227
00:16:08,676 --> 00:16:11,261
She's not here.
She's nowhere in this hall.

228
00:16:12,888 --> 00:16:16,141
Did she get eaten by a dog?

229
00:16:16,850 --> 00:16:20,396
Calm down, Yor! That idea is impossible.

230
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:23,273
In that case, was she…

231
00:16:23,357 --> 00:16:24,233
kidnapped?!

232
00:16:24,316 --> 00:16:27,569
Cases of young women being kidnapped
and forced into marriage

233
00:16:27,653 --> 00:16:29,822
are occurring frequently in Central Alian…

234
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:31,740
My, how scary!

235
00:16:32,658 --> 00:16:35,661
-I'll make you my wife.
-Oh no!

236
00:16:38,122 --> 00:16:40,165
What should I do?

237
00:16:40,249 --> 00:16:42,960
Anya will be forced into marriage!

238
00:16:43,043 --> 00:16:45,212
At a time like this
when Loid isn't with us!

239
00:16:45,295 --> 00:16:46,672
What should I do?

240
00:16:46,755 --> 00:16:48,424
What am I supposed to do?

241
00:16:49,049 --> 00:16:53,262
Loid, hurry up and come back
from the bathroom!

242
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:03,063
We got nothing from the two
hideout locations the kid told us about.

243
00:17:04,148 --> 00:17:05,065
How about you?

244
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:06,775
I got a lead.

245
00:17:07,276 --> 00:17:10,154
Two white vans were rented
under the name of

246
00:17:10,237 --> 00:17:11,989
one of the members, Kevin Knowles.

247
00:17:12,990 --> 00:17:13,824
License plate is…

248
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:17,077
Good work. I'll have someone
look into it right away.

249
00:17:17,786 --> 00:17:20,831
And as for the source of those dogs,

250
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:23,250
I'm starting to smell something fishy.

251
00:17:24,334 --> 00:17:26,628
I'm sure you've heard of it.

252
00:17:29,214 --> 00:17:30,632
Project Apple.

253
00:17:31,675 --> 00:17:33,552
The former Ostanian government

254
00:17:33,635 --> 00:17:35,095
conducted research

255
00:17:35,179 --> 00:17:39,475
to create highly intelligent animals
for military use.

256
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,602
I'm aware of that.

257
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:44,813
It seems like they were repeatedly
conducting extreme experiments,

258
00:17:44,897 --> 00:17:48,692
but the administration collapsed
and the research came to a stop.

259
00:17:48,776 --> 00:17:52,112
The research was incomplete,
ending nowhere near their objective.

260
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:56,200
Yes. There were rumors that those dogs
and research subjects

261
00:17:56,283 --> 00:18:00,245
were sold on the black market
instead of being destroyed.

262
00:18:01,038 --> 00:18:03,624
Do you think that the terrorists got
their hands on them?

263
00:18:04,166 --> 00:18:05,584
There's a possibility of that.

264
00:18:06,919 --> 00:18:09,630
Although they're survivors of
a failed experiment

265
00:18:09,713 --> 00:18:11,090
those dogs are still

266
00:18:11,173 --> 00:18:14,093
rather intelligent,
and they received training as well.

267
00:18:15,928 --> 00:18:17,346
Be careful.

268
00:18:18,013 --> 00:18:20,432
We may come across
an unexpected situation.

269
00:18:21,642 --> 00:18:24,311
Get away from that dog, little brat.

270
00:18:24,394 --> 00:18:27,106
I promise to finish you off
without much pain.

271
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:43,122
A phone call?

272
00:18:43,205 --> 00:18:45,624
Hey. You better hurry up, or I'll…

273
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:51,505
Man, that scared me.
Who's calling us at a time like this?

274
00:18:55,467 --> 00:18:56,552
Hello?

275
00:18:58,345 --> 00:18:59,721
What? Are you serious?

276
00:19:00,305 --> 00:19:01,932
We're in trouble, Keith!

277
00:19:02,015 --> 00:19:05,102
Some people raided two of our hideouts!

278
00:19:05,185 --> 00:19:07,479
Was it the Secret Police?

279
00:19:07,563 --> 00:19:10,357
Why? Did someone leak our information?

280
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:13,819
Kris has been missing
ever since this morning.

281
00:19:13,902 --> 00:19:16,321
So I was prepared for the worst, but…

282
00:19:16,405 --> 00:19:17,990
Good thing we changed location.

283
00:19:18,907 --> 00:19:20,617
Don't panic, everyone!

284
00:19:20,701 --> 00:19:23,704
We'll change to Plan B…

285
00:19:26,331 --> 00:19:28,208
Hey! Where's the kid?

286
00:19:28,292 --> 00:19:30,127
Huh? What?

287
00:19:35,465 --> 00:19:37,718
Doggie, are you on my side?

288
00:19:38,886 --> 00:19:42,681
More importantly, did you know
that the phone was going to ring?

289
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:46,268
You can see the future?

290
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:48,896
You're just like Anya.

291
00:19:49,646 --> 00:19:51,315
You have supernatural powers.

292
00:19:55,944 --> 00:19:58,405
Doggie, go inside that building.

293
00:19:58,488 --> 00:20:00,324
We're going to have Mother save us!

294
00:20:01,033 --> 00:20:02,826
No, don't go that way!

295
00:20:02,910 --> 00:20:04,328
Go back!

296
00:20:07,706 --> 00:20:08,999
Anya!

297
00:20:09,833 --> 00:20:11,001
Damn it!

298
00:20:11,585 --> 00:20:13,378
What have you bastards done?

299
00:20:13,462 --> 00:20:17,132
-We were distracted by the phone…
-We have bigger fish to fry!

300
00:20:17,216 --> 00:20:20,636
-Let's get on with our plan.
-Idiots! She saw us!

301
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:24,348
Come here, Kurt!
We'll take one of the dogs too!

302
00:20:24,431 --> 00:20:25,807
We're going after them?

303
00:20:26,391 --> 00:20:28,227
Take down the map on the wall.

304
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:29,603
We'll leave this hideout.

305
00:20:29,686 --> 00:20:32,397
You guys scatter and meet up
at the spot we planned on.

306
00:20:32,481 --> 00:20:33,523
Got it.

307
00:20:34,107 --> 00:20:36,902
Hey, stop right now and let me off!

308
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:39,655
Someone help me!

309
00:20:39,738 --> 00:20:42,199
Anya is being chased by bad guys!

310
00:20:42,282 --> 00:20:44,201
What's going on? How cute.

311
00:20:44,284 --> 00:20:46,328
Are they playing tag?

312
00:20:47,829 --> 00:20:50,415
Doggie runs very fast.

313
00:20:51,291 --> 00:20:53,210
It's so fast, and…

314
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:02,844
Exciting!

315
00:21:05,681 --> 00:21:07,015
All right, Doggie,

316
00:21:07,099 --> 00:21:10,602
let's outrun them
and go to the police station!

317
00:21:10,686 --> 00:21:11,979
Anya and Doggie

318
00:21:13,397 --> 00:21:16,900
will solve this case on our own,
and all will be well!

319
00:21:18,026 --> 00:21:21,905
And I will become Starlight Anya
once again!

320
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:37,504
That saved us time.

321
00:21:37,587 --> 00:21:40,340
We're back to where we started!

322
00:21:40,924 --> 00:21:42,592
Turn around and go right!

323
00:21:46,638 --> 00:21:48,265
I won't let you go.

324
00:21:49,474 --> 00:21:51,351
Kill her. Quickly.

325
00:21:51,435 --> 00:21:52,519
Sure.

326
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:00,068
Don't resent me for this.

327
00:22:18,712 --> 00:22:20,088
I will not allow this.

328
00:22:20,172 --> 00:22:22,591
You perverted kidnapper.

329
00:22:23,717 --> 00:22:26,511
It's too early for marriage for Anya!

330
00:24:08,321 --> 00:24:10,866
MISSION:14
DISARM THE TIME BOMB

331
00:24:10,949 --> 00:24:11,825
Subtitle translation by: Lili Morita
